  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n16y2 − k = (4 y+(3)/(2))(4 y−(3)/(2)) \n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(a + b)(a - b) = a² - b²\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ 16y2 − k = (4 y+(3)/(2))(4 y−(3)/(2)) \n\n⇒ 16y2 − k = (4y)²-((3)/(2))²\n\n⇒ 16y² - k = 16y² - (9)/(4)\n\n⇒ -k = - 9/4\n\n⇒ k = 9/4\n\n⇒ **Hence, The value of k is 9/4**\n\n26",
